## 5. 创新与性能（工程师）【仓库推断】

### 5.1 数据模式
- 唯一数据源是岛数据 JSON。
- 手填字段：
  - `altitude_m`：真实海拔，z 由它派生；
  - `dist_tier`：near / mid / far / horizon；
  - `depth_bias`：±0.3，手动推远或拉近。
- 派生字段：`tools/depth_derive.py` 算出后回写 `derived`，不手填。
- 公式（线性，便于调参）：
  - d = clamp(0.55·(1 − alt_n) + 0.45·dist_n + depth_bias, 0, 1)
  - scale = 1 − 0.42·d
  - haze = 0.05 + 0.6·d²
  - ward_alpha = 0.55·(1 − d)^1.5
  - 标签字号 = 15 − 4·d px，不透明度 = 1 − 0.45·d；d > 0.8 时只显示图标
- 示例：海拔按第 2 节合并表；伊甸的 ward_alpha 固定为 0。

```json
{
 "depth_model": {"alt_range_m": [800, 1500], "tint_near": "#f3e2c0", "tint_far": "#9fb3c8",
   "cloud_layers": [{"id":"c1","alt_m":1150},{"id":"c2","alt_m":1020},{"id":"c3","alt_m":930}]},
 "islands": [
  {"id":"eden_estate",      "name":"伊甸庄园",       "altitude_m":1450,"dist_tier":"near","depth_bias":-0.1,"ward_alpha_override":0},
  {"id":"kelly_residence",  "name":"凯莉的宅邸",     "altitude_m":1360,"dist_tier":"near","depth_bias":0},
  {"id":"pm_residence",     "name":"首相府",         "altitude_m":1300,"dist_tier":"mid", "depth_bias":0},
  {"id":"rothschild_estate","name":"罗斯柴尔德庄园", "altitude_m":1250,"dist_tier":"mid", "depth_bias":-0.05},
  {"id":"elite_academy",    "name":"精英学院",       "altitude_m":1180,"dist_tier":"mid", "depth_bias":0},
  {"id":"league_clubhouse", "name":"庄园主联盟会所", "altitude_m":1080,"dist_tier":"mid", "depth_bias":0},
  {"id":"victor_manor",     "name":"维克多庄园",     "altitude_m":960, "dist_tier":"far", "depth_bias":0},
  {"id":"y_manor",          "name":"「Y」的庄园",    "altitude_m":880, "dist_tier":"horizon","depth_bias":0.1,"ward_edge_keep":true},
