   - `main.js` L71: set `SUN_DIR` to (-0.9, 0.26, 0.34), about 15°.
   - Sun intensity 3.1 → 3.4; hemi 0.5 → 0.38.
   - Pull `FOG_ON` near/far in to roughly 55%/85% of the current distances so the lake and woodland edge warm up.
